WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.975
A console program asks a question, waits for an answer, and replies.

2
00:00:05.826 --> 00:00:10.101
input shows a question, then waits for someone to type an answer.

3
00:00:10.852 --> 00:00:14.702
